    {
      "id": 184797,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "Poor delimiter handling in `@actions/core` led to a remote attacker being able to define arbitrary environment variables. In a separate report, #1637621, remote code execution in the GitHub Actions runner enabled by this bug was demonstrated.",
